  "htmlContent": "<p>因為雲端虛擬機不會包含本機的 <code>.env</code> 檔案，所以必須將金鑰存放在 GitHub 儲存庫的 <strong>Secrets</strong> 裡面供腳本讀取。</p>\n<p><img src=\"/images/notion/4113eb21-f1cc-80d4-97e4-ef3788bdfa16-1.png\" alt=\"image.png\"></p>\n<p>需要以下兩個金鑰，點上圖綠色新增即可。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code><strong>NOTION_API_KEY</strong></code></li>\n<li><code><strong>NOTION_DATABASE_ID</strong></code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://prod-files-secure.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/31682f85-b904-4805-902e-18126780c624/3a3210e3-1b45-4e6f-9c69-03f97fe5894c/image.png?X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&amp;X-Amz-Content-Sha256=UNSIGNED-PAYLOAD&amp;X-Amz-Credential=ASIAZI2LB4665N56QHDN%2F20261128%2Fus-west-2%2Fs3%2Faws4_request&amp;X-Amz-Date=20261128T014333Z&amp;X-Amz-Expires=3600&amp;X-Amz-Security-Token=IQoJb3JpZ2luX2VjEBQaCXVzLXdlc3QtMiJGMEQCIAqNyMQCTGjgFBAB9aShKIQ%2Bab8CZM%2Fqj3%2FmWCSYsPfDAiB65R5Fczidq%2B228vUbyn5pjXyoRlBfUXk1IQOUb7JUmCqIBAjc%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F8BEAAaDDYzNzQyMzE4MzgwNSIMNkb2RYdzA3h22h4MKtwDETJe4J%2F5YybDADarjxPjCZ3PwEUHW2gqL9OcXNnrw7lgj46kmTFy4RVyFggWime9qjga7yuOINOfAz%2B6fgeTivbv1gI4DCl9HNDJMZ7eYBVdxU6OwlW6LiObTOwMWbzmgpimHsK54vA3731m3eSt4UxrIPK58ucOY5djrFRDqEz086c%2FCyHL15aytfydDfNNLMyOrKdXHQH9Juy3DRNuijc1LIPogZjhKGm%2F0Gcpdg1aDc0BqFXuJ8mqq0GoNoPQ7RgnCr%2FmCRcnJP7Gk1lq1nDQHb35FUWGmgK%2ByAS8JLGjkb%2BOr6JGzFKMzcpOdEXCQFd0bgVy3kp8FcYoeRCZrkc6BkpOc5tkkXZ6N0uz%2F8j57R%2BI4HMlXfvWR%2Fw%2FhRK79Nq2Nd6uZGUeAoCpRIAqNGmkexYr3gjF8Gz442QLV6shdoRLUQh3s2bylitObeCRzBh26MuogGVt4fynyrIpMAmIliF3pn2G1Zh4HX2vnLXaWSeqELvcyylKFhfZ8Ncr781ySrLOAjjx31mPVkTXtgP2Ck52gwrSxpS5QWAPl2s0MX3Cxmar%2FHARaPSJFvOGJ9ZiBsISeGytytuLZ3jRVcq3TpkIfsAgzhNLUEGQsD5nRoAhYOaq2Jkirogw5sen2AY6pgGk5fm52kyqZTm1Y21eCC052gM18%2BFmQ7blr%2BoCbrWezLJP56UgZquUUe2IvuDE0BSxG%2FplOI73Mn2voG2eFZSWeZta%2BVKYjLJDmRLgCMRaFzXwqk3APn8fq8DpfHvAPmtiGvNOKmgqMWzKXuqEqrOXTndj22uNt16yiH3hB9Ouqg%2B84FfBVmQMhHGn7Ij9b27AbSCkdapZrTIyitPbisejYcneRjbM&amp;X-Amz-Signature=1f0cd242cdaf54f1faf429d982eae1da01ed163637ce5f83a67ba22a25f27a94&amp;X-Amz-SignedHeaders=host&amp;x-amz-checksum-mode=ENABLED&amp;x-id=GetObject\" alt=\"image.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"/images/notion/4113eb21-f1cc-80d4-97e4-ef3788bdfa16-2.png\" alt=\"image.png\"></p>\n<p>回到action頁面，點右側Run workflow</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://prod-files-secure.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/31682f85-b904-4805-902e-18126780c624/e5d9cc8d-b9ae-4f89-a7f3-abab9e47d197/image.png?X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&amp;X-Amz-Content-Sha256=UNSIGNED-PAYLOAD&amp;X-Amz-Credential=ASIAZI2LB4665N56QHDN%2F20261128%2Fus-west-2%2Fs3%2Faws4_request&amp;X-Amz-Date=20261128T014333Z&amp;X-Amz-Expires=3600&amp;X-Amz-Security-Token=IQoJb3JpZ2luX2VjEBQaCXVzLXdlc3QtMiJGMEQCIAqNyMQCTGjgFBAB9aShKIQ%2Bab8CZM%2Fqj3%2FmWCSYsPfDAiB65R5Fczidq%2B228vUbyn5pjXyoRlBfUXk1IQOUb7JUmCqIBAjc%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F8BEAAaDDYzNzQyMzE4MzgwNSIMNkb2RYdzA3h22h4MKtwDETJe4J%2F5YybDADarjxPjCZ3PwEUHW2gqL9OcXNnrw7lgj46kmTFy4RVyFggWime9qjga7yuOINOfAz%2B6fgeTivbv1gI4DCl9HNDJMZ7eYBVdxU6OwlW6LiObTOwMWbzmgpimHsK54vA3731m3eSt4UxrIPK58ucOY5djrFRDqEz086c%2FCyHL15aytfydDfNNLMyOrKdXHQH9Juy3DRNuijc1LIPogZjhKGm%2F0Gcpdg1aDc0BqFXuJ8mqq0GoNoPQ7RgnCr%2FmCRcnJP7Gk1lq1nDQHb35FUWGmgK%2ByAS8JLGjkb%2BOr6JGzFKMzcpOdEXCQFd0bgVy3kp8FcYoeRCZrkc6BkpOc5tkkXZ6N0uz%2F8j57R%2BI4HMlXfvWR%2Fw%2FhRK79Nq2Nd6uZGUeAoCpRIAqNGmkexYr3gjF8Gz442QLV6shdoRLUQh3s2bylitObeCRzBh26MuogGVt4fynyrIpMAmIliF3pn2G1Zh4HX2vnLXaWSeqELvcyylKFhfZ8Ncr781ySrLOAjjx31mPVkTXtgP2Ck52gwrSxpS5QWAPl2s0MX3Cxmar%2FHARaPSJFvOGJ9ZiBsISeGytytuLZ3jRVcq3TpkIfsAgzhNLUEGQsD5nRoAhYOaq2Jkirogw5sen2AY6pgGk5fm52kyqZTm1Y21eCC052gM18%2BFmQ7blr%2BoCbrWezLJP56UgZquUUe2IvuDE0BSxG%2FplOI73Mn2voG2eFZSWeZta%2BVKYjLJDmRLgCMRaFzXwqk3APn8fq8DpfHvAPmtiGvNOKmgqMWzKXuqEqrOXTndj22uNt16yiH3hB9Ouqg%2B84FfBVmQMhHGn7Ij9b27AbSCkdapZrTIyitPbisejYcneRjbM&amp;X-Amz-Signature=b0d97697f283edcf964c0766fb9a2e7f6c1fdccd9d184f1188b1cbc1056d2446&amp;X-Amz-SignedHeaders=host&amp;x-amz-checksum-mode=ENABLED&amp;x-id=GetObject\" alt=\"image.png\"></p>\n<p>等待幾秒重新整理，確認狀態變為綠色打勾 ✅，同步功能即可恢復正常每 3 小時自動執行。</p>\n<p><img src=\"/images/notion/4113eb21-f1cc-80d4-97e4-ef3788bdfa16-3.png\" alt=\"image.png\"></p>\n",
  "plainText": "因為雲端虛擬機不會包含本機的 .env 檔案，所以必須將金鑰存放在 GitHub 儲存庫的 Secrets 裡面供腳本讀取。 需要以下兩個金鑰，點上圖綠色新增即可。 NOTION_API_KEY NOTION_DATABASE_ID 回到action頁面，點右側Run workflow 等待幾秒重新整理，確認狀態變為綠色打勾 ✅，同步功能即可恢復正常每 3 小時自動執行。"
}